{"植物总花费（美元）": 7352}
{"火车行驶距离（公里）": 6438}
{"花园面积（平方米）": 5172}
{"每个孩子分到的糖（颗）": 23}
{"水箱剩余水量（升）": 643}
{"所求人数（人）": 247}
{"发票总额（美元）": 2754}
{"登山者攀登总高度（米）": 1385}

Rules:
- The result must be exactly correct; work it out silently and double-check it before writing anything.
- The key must make plain which quantity the number is, using the question's own nouns translated into Chinese.
